---
title: CMN — Mail Template Send Paths
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant EH as Domain Event Handler<br/>(Administration API)
    participant CUST as Customer API<br/>Application Service
    participant GRPC_C as gRPC Client<br/>(CustomerAPI → AdminAPI)
    participant GRPC_S as AdministrationServiceMailTemplateGrpc<br/>(port :50051 TLS)
    participant UOW as IUnitOfWorkManager
    participant MT as MailTemplateAppService<br/>.SendEmailAsync
    participant MONGO as MongoDB<br/>(swt_cmn.adm_MailTemplate)
    participant ES as IEmailSender<br/>(MailKit / SMTP)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over EH,ES: Path A — Direct (Administration API domain event)
        EH->>MT: SendEmailAsync(templateCode, recipients, dataDictionary)
        MT->>MT: Validate: recipients list not empty
        MT->>MONGO: FindAsync WHERE Code = @templateCode
        MONGO-->>MT: MailTemplate { Subject, Body, ... }
        MT->>MT: For each ##Group.Field## in Subject+Body:<br/>replace with dataDictionary[key]<br/>(shortCode default = "##")
        alt Settings:Abp.Mailing.IsTesting == true
            MT->>MT: Redirect To: override addresses<br/>Prefix subject with "[TEST]"
        end
        MT->>ES: IEmailSender.SendAsync(to, subject, body)
        ES->>ES: MailKit SMTP send<br/>Host: Settings:Abp.Mailing.Smtp.Host<br/>Port: Settings:Abp.Mailing.Smtp.Port<br/>User: Settings:Abp.Mailing.Smtp.UserName
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over CUST,ES: Path B — Via gRPC (Customer API → Administration API)
        CUST->>GRPC_C: MailTemplateGrpcClient.SendEmailAsync(SendMailTemplateRequest)
        GRPC_C->>GRPC_S: gRPC call to :50051 (TLS HTTP/2)<br/>SendMailTemplateRequest { TemplateCode, Recipients[], DataDictionary{} }
        GRPC_S->>UOW: IUnitOfWorkManager.Begin()
        GRPC_S->>MT: IMailTemplateAppService.SendEmailAsync(...)
        MT->>MONGO: Find template
        MT->>MT: Replace placeholders
        MT->>ES: IEmailSender.SendAsync
        ES-->>MT: Sent
        MT-->>GRPC_S: Success
        GRPC_S-->>GRPC_C: SendMailTemplateResponse { IsSuccess: true, Data: "...", Error: null }
        GRPC_C-->>CUST: Response

        Note over GRPC_S: On any exception:
        GRPC_S->>GRPC_C: SendMailTemplateResponse { IsSuccess: false, Data: null, Error: ex.Message }
    end
